                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0e2e3122-ecf8-4367-9c22-52cca6e037e0",
                        "source_entry_id": "a11b479a-d0de-3a0e-b9f1-8ae1199a1a04",
                        "source_sense_id": "dbc45670-2d33-3230-a3f1-71ac44e97e4c",
                        "source_sense_description": "de vorm hebbend van een peer, dus rond met één enkele uitloper",
                        "target_lang_word": "birnenförmig",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "birnenförmig",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b47803c3-8511-3329-bc1b-b7048861ed6c",
                                        "entry_id": "3b8563ea-873c-3b07-af2a-f7b71f19dbd1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "geformt wie eine Birne; wie eine Birne aussehend"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4676a7e7-1453-4ec6-b14f-e5aa15cfe004",
                                                "sense_id": "b47803c3-8511-3329-bc1b-b7048861ed6c",
                                                "text": "„Bei Frauen hingegen verteilt sich das Fett meist birnenförmig auf Hüften, Po und Oberschenkel.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ff34718-1fd0-4079-8a89-b9e4ed7dd8bd",
                                                "sense_id": "b47803c3-8511-3329-bc1b-b7048861ed6c",
                                                "text": "„Der sichtbar glühende, aufgezwirbelte Draht und die Glasblase, die sich birnenförmig nach oben weitet, waren konstruktiv bedingt, versöhnten aber auch mit dem Verlust des lebendig züngelnden Feuers.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4bda7e68-ed5b-4e47-b669-90fd40df63ae",
                                                "sense_id": "b47803c3-8511-3329-bc1b-b7048861ed6c",
                                                "text": "„Typisch für die meist aus Feuerstein und anderen feinkörnigen Gesteinsarten hergestellten Faustkeile ist die durch beiderseitige Abschläge hergestellte dreieckige bis birnenförmige Form.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e8ee8667-da9e-4bf2-a126-ffe5f8d1b70d",
                        "source_entry_id": "a11b479a-d0de-3a0e-b9f1-8ae1199a1a04",
                        "source_sense_id": "dbc45670-2d33-3230-a3f1-71ac44e97e4c",
                        "source_sense_description": "de vorm hebbend van een peer, dus rond met één enkele uitloper",
                        "target_lang_word": "pear-shaped",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pear-shaped",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca59ec48-d21a-3121-8a85-81eed956b6fd",
                                        "entry_id": "aab3d54c-da66-38b2-b57e-e4bab7097e71",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having a shape of a (typical western) pear, or in cross-section, like the cross-section of a pear."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "012ff9aa-4a3a-4a01-91ae-2e690bc647e3",
                                                "sense_id": "ca59ec48-d21a-3121-8a85-81eed956b6fd",
                                                "text": "Single egg laid directly on ledge, pear-shaped to prevent rolling off[.]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "23e5e1fe-29d6-3cc9-aa58-e1be60e7822a",
                                        "entry_id": "aab3d54c-da66-38b2-b57e-e4bab7097e71",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having a shape of a (typical western) pear, or in cross-section, like the cross-section of a pear.",
                                            "Having gynoid fat distribution, not android fat distribution."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3dbd74b9-4999-4cea-adb0-271404752b1d",
                                                "sense_id": "23e5e1fe-29d6-3cc9-aa58-e1be60e7822a",
                                                "text": "pear-shaped obesity versus apple-shaped obesity"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa80c029-3718-4f4f-90e0-ec1482e488b1",
                                                "sense_id": "23e5e1fe-29d6-3cc9-aa58-e1be60e7822a",
                                                "text": "Just as one should take sitting-up exercises every day to keep one's figure from going pear-shaped in the hips, one should spend at least a little time, even if it is only very little, sloughing off mental flabbiness by thinking, studying or just reading something that requires an exercising effort of the mind to understand, memorise or digest."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c168c3a-c6be-49f8-bd19-509b3b401257",
                                                "sense_id": "23e5e1fe-29d6-3cc9-aa58-e1be60e7822a",
                                                "text": "Even at BMIs above 30, where obesity begins, men and women whose waist-to-hip ratio identified them as more pear-shaped were less likely to die -- of any cause and of cardiovascular causes -- than those with similar BMIs who were apple-shaped."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "98b29bd8-3877-312b-b3f3-08a5bd9e2163",
                                        "entry_id": "aab3d54c-da66-38b2-b57e-e4bab7097e71",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "rich, mellow, sonorous"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a vocal or musical tone"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d77afbc5-05f2-3ea1-9684-f21abb291174",
                                        "entry_id": "aab3d54c-da66-38b2-b57e-e4bab7097e71",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Wrong, awry, usually in the phrase go pear-shaped."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Commonwealth",
                                            "Ireland",
                                            "UK",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "170cfa62-5eb3-4094-b541-946de80ad03f",
                        "source_entry_id": "a11b479a-d0de-3a0e-b9f1-8ae1199a1a04",
                        "source_sense_id": "dbc45670-2d33-3230-a3f1-71ac44e97e4c",
                        "source_sense_description": "de vorm hebbend van een peer, dus rond met één enkele uitloper",
                        "target_lang_word": "piriforme",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "piriforme",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6cf1610d-9420-36b4-821d-0c928592b57f",
                                        "entry_id": "4dd0918f-a440-3b16-806e-54d631611490",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est en forme de poire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Didactique"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3fba9948-5827-48fe-825f-f35d1ec57fec",
                                                "sense_id": "6cf1610d-9420-36b4-821d-0c928592b57f",
                                                "text": "C’était un homme sec, dont le crâne chauve par-devant, garni de cheveux rares par derrière, avait une conformation piriforme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58425abc-f7da-4759-8f28-750f40cce81f",
                                                "sense_id": "6cf1610d-9420-36b4-821d-0c928592b57f",
                                                "text": "Ce n’est guère que vers le dixième jour qu’on voit s’élever de la partie inférieure du canal intestinal une petite vésicule piriforme que nous avons nommée allantoïde […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37b83457-4fad-4f0a-8406-1919d2ee7498",
                                                "sense_id": "6cf1610d-9420-36b4-821d-0c928592b57f",
                                                "text": "Elle avait une tête piriforme, des joues qui ballottaient, dégonflées, un nez fastueux et tombant bas […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8864a801-64c5-4766-815e-79b01b9e46d6",
                                                "sense_id": "6cf1610d-9420-36b4-821d-0c928592b57f",
                                                "text": "Il alla prendre l’Ubu électrique sur un rayon ; l’Ubu électrique soutenait de son bras-nageoire un parapluie de soie rouge qui formait abat-jour et une tête piriforme qui distribuait la lumière à travers de gros yeux loufoques."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fceb530a-b6da-4ad7-a11b-45d2f4ea3098",
                                                "sense_id": "6cf1610d-9420-36b4-821d-0c928592b57f",
                                                "text": "Quérolle, qui rêvassait encore au lit, descend en ajustant ses bretelles. C’est un poussah piriforme ; la tête est petite et pointue ; le menton semble s’être fondu dans le cou, le cou avoir coulé dans les épaules, et le torse s’élargir jusqu’au fond du pantalon. S’il s’asseyait à terre, rien ne pourrait le renverser."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "baab83bd-245a-438d-9b56-07e612e53c81",
                        "source_entry_id": "a11b479a-d0de-3a0e-b9f1-8ae1199a1a04",
                        "source_sense_id": "dbc45670-2d33-3230-a3f1-71ac44e97e4c",
